### 管理员菜品管理 HTTP Client 手动测试
### 需要在 IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client 提示时提供真实 ADMIN 管理员账号、密码和启用分类 ID。
### 所有管理请求都会修改数据；DELETE 会逻辑删除菜品。本文件仅准备请求，本次未执行。

### 0. 管理员登录并保存 JWT 到 IDEA 全局变量
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNo": "admin_test_001",
  "password": "12345678"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 管理员分页查询菜品（包含下架菜品）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes?page=1&size=10&sort=latest
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 2. 新增菜品（初始状态为 OFF_SALE）；需使用启用分类 ID
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "HTTP 测试菜品",
  "description": "管理员接口联调测试",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test-dish.jpg",
  "price": 12.50,
  "stock": 20
}

> {%
  client.global.set("dishId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. 查看新增菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. 修改菜品基本信息（categoryId 必须指向启用分类）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "name": "HTTP 测试菜品（已修改）",
  "description": "已更新介绍",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/test-dish-updated.jpg"
}

### 5. 上架菜品（所属分类必须启用）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ON_SALE"
}

### 6. 修改库存（必须大于等于0）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 25
}

### 7. 修改价格（必须非负，最多2位小数）
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}/price
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 13.00
}

### 8. 下架菜品
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OFF_SALE"
}

### 9. 逻辑删除菜品（谨慎手动执行；不会物理删除数据库记录）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/{{dishId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 10. 测试修改菜品价格（验证 13.80）

PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/dishes/1/price
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "price": 18.00
}